@ShopEase.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5157

### Public product catalogue
GET {{ShopEase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Public categories
GET {{ShopEase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Register a customer (replace email if already registered)
POST {{ShopEase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Demo Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### Login (copy token from response and use it as Bearer token below)
POST {{ShopEase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### Current authenticated user (replace TOKEN)
GET {{ShopEase.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Accept: application/json
